WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.585 --> 00:00:13.153
The old woman walked toward Roxy.

2
00:00:13.173 --> 00:00:14.634
"Who are you?"

3
00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.435
Roxy asked, looking around.

4
00:00:16.455 --> 00:00:18.417
"And where did you come from?"

5
00:00:18.437 --> 00:00:22.280
"I'm the mountain's spirit," the woman said.

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.961
"You're a spirit?"

7
00:00:24.342 --> 00:00:26.063
Roxy asked, lifting an eyebrow.

8
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:33.825
"I used to control everything that happens on this mountain," the woman said, nodding.

9
00:00:33.845 --> 00:00:39.450
"It was called Birdsong Mountain, and it was a beautiful place.

10
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:43.153
Flowers and wildlife filled its slopes.

11
00:00:44.013 --> 00:00:48.957
There were villages, where people raised families and traded goods."

12
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:52.580
"What happened?"

13
00:00:53.021 --> 00:00:53.701
Roxy asked.

14
00:00:53.721 --> 00:01:01.868
"Several years ago a violent storm formed over the mountain," the spirit said sadly.

15
00:01:02.936 --> 00:01:07.577
"Powerful winds blew down trees and houses.

16
00:01:08.418 --> 00:01:12.399
Rain poured down for weeks, causing floods.

17
00:01:13.019 --> 00:01:17.780
The terrible storm was caused by the Demon of Black Rain.

18
00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:23.502
With the help of his demon army, he took over the mountain.

19
00:01:24.222 --> 00:01:26.223
He stole it from me!

20
00:01:26.983 --> 00:01:29.604
The villagers and wildlife fled.

21
00:01:30.152 --> 00:01:35.236
Birdsong Mountain has been a dangerous place ever since."

22
00:01:35.256 --> 00:01:37.117
"That's awful!"

23
00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:38.178
Roxy said.

24
00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:40.359
"But I'm not scared of that demon.

25
00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:43.341
I'll go up there and get rid of him for you."

26
00:01:43.361 --> 00:01:46.223
"No!" the spirit said.

27
00:01:46.243 --> 00:01:52.047
"The Demon of Black Rain is too powerful—and dangerous."

28
00:01:52.067 --> 00:01:54.829
"But I have to go," Roxy said.

29
00:01:54.849 --> 00:01:58.572
"The demon has prisoners, and he's going to eat one of them!"

30
00:01:59.988 --> 00:02:06.993
"Yes, sometimes demons capture and eat people," the spirit said with a sigh.

31
00:02:07.873 --> 00:02:12.777
"Perhaps the victim is a poor farmer or even a rich king.

32
00:02:13.517 --> 00:02:15.519
But there's nothing we can do."

33
00:02:16.599 --> 00:02:17.580
Roxy shook her head.

34
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:20.682
"This prisoner isn't a farmer or a king.

35
00:02:21.262 --> 00:02:23.003
He's someone called the Tang Monk."

36
00:02:23.904 --> 00:02:24.985
The spirit gasped.

37
00:02:25.005 --> 00:02:29.388
"The Tang Monk is very important!"

38
00:02:30.228 --> 00:02:31.729
"Why?" Roxy asked.

39
00:02:31.749 --> 00:02:37.052
"The Tang Monk is traveling to the West," the spirit said.

40
00:02:37.072 --> 00:02:41.574
"He hopes to receive the True Scriptures from Buddha.

41
00:02:42.115 --> 00:02:46.537
The scriptures will help the people in the Tang Empire to be good.

42
00:02:47.377 --> 00:02:50.019
Everyone wants him to succeed."

43
00:02:50.039 --> 00:02:53.701
"Wow!" Roxy said.

44
00:02:53.721 --> 00:02:59.324
"But there's no need to worry," the spirit added with a smile.

45
00:03:00.168 --> 00:03:02.289
"I just remembered something!

46
00:03:03.029 --> 00:03:09.311
The Tang Monk is traveling with a very powerful spirit who can destroy demons.

47
00:03:10.031 --> 00:03:14.292
His name is Sun Wukong, the Monkey King.

48
00:03:15.092 --> 00:03:18.293
He once defeated Heaven's entire army."

49
00:03:19.353 --> 00:03:20.193
Roxy bit her lip.

50
00:03:20.213 --> 00:03:24.495
"I actually met Sun Wukong, and I have some bad news.

51
00:03:25.235 --> 00:03:29.276
He's in another world right now, so he's not here to help the Tang Monk."

52
00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.220
"Oh dear."

53
00:03:31.721 --> 00:03:32.901
The spirit looked nervous.

54
00:03:33.901 --> 00:03:35.202
Roxy glanced up at the cave.

55
00:03:35.222 --> 00:03:39.703
"I don't have a choice, Spirit—I have to save the Tang Monk."

56
00:03:40.383 --> 00:03:41.644
The spirit looked thoughtful.

57
00:03:41.664 --> 00:03:45.325
"Perhaps we can save him together.

58
00:03:45.345 --> 00:03:48.286
I think I have a plan."

59
00:03:52.547 --> 00:03:56.028
Detective Smith was in his office at police headquarters, talking on the phone.

60
00:03:56.940 --> 00:04:00.782
"Tell every police officer in Metro City to search for a pig and monkey.

61
00:04:01.382 --> 00:04:03.904
They're under arrest for breaking out of jail."

62
00:04:03.924 --> 00:04:09.887
"Detective!" Mayor Bloom cried, hurrying into the office.

63
00:04:10.847 --> 00:04:13.029
He was breathing heavily, and his tie was loose.

64
00:04:14.109 --> 00:04:15.550
Detective Smith hung up the phone.

65
00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.091
"What's wrong, Mayor?

66
00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:18.491
Why are you out of breath?"

67
00:04:18.512 --> 00:04:26.636
"I ran here all the way from City Hall," the mayor said between breaths.

68
00:04:27.316 --> 00:04:28.398
"We have a big problem.

69
00:04:29.319 --> 00:04:32.783
An army of monkeys and apes has taken over Metro City!"
